<p>Over the next <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns, you attempt to remove the target from the timeline, lowering its resistance to physical and temporal damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 30%, 37%, 44%, 50%.</acronym></p><p>If you manage to kill the target while the spell is in effect, you'll be returned to the point in time you cast this spell and the target will be slain.</p><p>This spell splits the timeline.  Attempting to use another spell that also splits the timeline while this effect is active will be unsuccessful.</p><p>The resistance penalty will scale with your Spellpower.</p>